{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF ROPER INSURANCE AND FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC.', 'text': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF ROPER INSURANCE AND FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC. ON OCTOBER 18, 2019. FOLLOWING THE TRANSACTION, THE ROPER INSURANCE TEAM WILL RELOCATE TO BROWN & BROWN’S DENVER, COLORADO OFFICE AND WILL OPERATE UNDER THE LEADERSHIP OF JASON SARTOR, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF BROWN & BROWN OF COLORADO.\nBROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF ROPER INSURANCE AND FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC. ON OCTOBER 18, 2019.\n'}